{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S05等短时段仍有信息拥挤的问题，少数心理补写也略显过满，容易把本可留白的感受说得太确定。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点句有明确的视觉锚点，感受文字又缩小并按音乐节点出现，观众可以先抓住人物心理，再在音乐推进时接收细节，不必一开始面对整片短词。更重要的是，X把怕暴露需要、得到回应、害怕失去、逐渐接纳自己的喜欢串成了清楚的心理因果链，前后变化更容易理解，音乐和情绪的细微起伏也对应得更具体。Y的左右分区有一定扫读优势，但右侧短词容易成为彼此孤立的感受集合，人物心理变化的连接感稍弱。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6893fdbb-2f08-4764-9e6b-897d27475c28", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T001656143369Z", "elapsed_seconds": 62.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:17:58.172508+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4cd3984594a2ed2fff7a15cd388aca63c9d9251f8614c45d46a80ee2395cab06", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp